# Root-owned copies: <repo path>  <system path>
#
# These cannot be symlinks -- /etc is not ours to link into. Copies drift silently, which
# is the failure mode this repo keeps warning about, so the bootstrap diffs them and
# reports it rather than pretending.
#
# Empty until the lid decision is made. If design B is chosen -- umbriel owns the lid --
# it needs a logind drop-in setting HandleLidSwitch=ignore, and that file belongs here so
# its drift is visible. If design A is chosen, logind keeps its default and there is
# nothing to copy, but the thing that locks on PrepareForSleep will need a home.
#
# See the lid section of hosts/rigel/umbriel/config.toml. Do not add anything here until
# one of the two is actually chosen and physically tested.
